                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Avg. THT Chats (mins) :</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:avg_tht_chats_mins:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Chat THT Improvement (percentage) :</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:chat_tht_improvement:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Saved time per chat (mins):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Saved time per chat (min) 1 (copy)_1161647232326656002:qk]>  ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Avg. THT Chats (mins) * Chat THT Improvement)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Avg. HT Non Live (mins)  : </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:avg_ht_non_live_mins:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Non Live AHT Improvement (percentage) :</run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[ <[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:non_live_aht_improvement:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Saved time per non-live (mins):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Saved time per non-live (min) 1 (copy)_1161647232327401476:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> (Avg. HT Non Live (mins)  * Non Live AHT Improvement )</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Adoption Rate Chats (percentage) : </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:adoption_rate_chats:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Adoption Rate Non-Live (percentage) :</run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:adoption_rate_non_live:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Adoption Rate (Chats &amp; Non-Live) (percentage) :</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#787878'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:adoption_rate_chats_and_non_live:qk]> ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Adoption Rate Chats + Adoption Rate Non-Live)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Herocare Launch AHT Improvement : </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:herocare_launch_aht_improvement:qk]> ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Chat THT Improvement  + Non Live AHT Improvement )</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>HrC Launch Saved time (mins) :</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:HeroCare launch saved time (min) 1 (copy)_1161647232327147523:qk]> ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Avg. THT Chats (mins) * Herocare Launch AHT Improvement)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Saved Hours :</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Calculation_1161647232326078465:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>((## of chats * Adoption Rate (Chats &amp; Non-Live) *  Saved time per chat (mins)) + </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(## of chats * Adoption Rate (Chats &amp; Non-Live) *  HrC Launch Saved time (mins)) + </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(## of non-live requests * Saved time per non-live (mins)*  Adoption Rate (Chats &amp; Non-Live)))/60</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Saved FTEs :</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Saved FTEs (copy)_1161647232328917000:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> (Saved Hours  /  FTE Hours set in </run>
                <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='8'>Projected Savings</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> section)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Personnel Savings :</run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[ <[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Personnel Savings 1 (copy)_1161647232329060361:qk]>  ]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Saved FTEs * Avg. agent salary set in </run>
                <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='8'>Projected Savings</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> section</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#898989'>Non Personnel Savings: </run>
                <run bold='true'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[sum:Non personnel Savings (copy)_343258742413709312:qk]>]]></run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>(Freshchat licences cost </run>
                <run>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>set in </run>
                <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='8'>Projected Savings</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> section + Salesforce licences cost</run>
                <run bold='true'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'>set in </run>
                <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontsize='8'>Projected Savings</run>
                <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='8'> section * Adoption Rate Chats &amp; Non Live)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c20006'>Actual Savings :</run>
                <run fontcolor='#c20006'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'><![CDATA[<[federated.0vb6umm0j9rayx1g39o210wryckh].[usr:Savings (copy)_1161647232329228298:qk:4]> ]]></run>
